{"steam_appid":962090,"steam_name":"Common'hood","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/962090/507717/0e91bf62e03aa7e4f1caad4c6c39f5c232f9fa5c/1751169281/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1666652544","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256912594/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1666652544","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/ss_bb3adf9551a61065b0889820e7032536d046876c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698939024","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/ss_0cca2f966bbb932d606314bca0f2c290b7d5c511.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698939024","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/ss_77400a72aa22690491613ca89ff6777e2d5415bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698939024","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/ss_c21a4b3dcb865ae4b69af951cf5bb0a42303c43c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698939024","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/ss_8af6a2d5b3b9cfdd5161fd7c7141eb902089e793.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698939024"],"about_the_game":"Common’hood is a community building and economy management game with highly customizable base building tools. Scavenge for materials,  build a home, grow your own food, research new technology, craft new tools, build a new family. Form your community and take it from surviving to thriving!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/f553ae355f380135193eb22dbae980ec.poster.avif?t=1698939024\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/f553ae355f380135193eb22dbae980ec.webm?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/f553ae355f380135193eb22dbae980ec.mp4?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highly detailed building tools</strong></h2>Build a thriving community by growing food, crafting shelters, workshops, and eventually high-tech manufacturing facilities. Your workshop gives you access to unique creation materials where every detail is in your hand. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/762ff26e9a71c97d388a6693ac38433d.poster.avif?t=1698939024\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/762ff26e9a71c97d388a6693ac38433d.webm?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/762ff26e9a71c97d388a6693ac38433d.mp4?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take care of your settlers</strong></h2>Your settlers will have needs and aspirations. Take them from poverty and misery to becoming key members of a wholesome community.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/c2269898ca71975016d4ea30ad925dd9.poster.avif?t=1698939024\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/c2269898ca71975016d4ea30ad925dd9.webm?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/c2269898ca71975016d4ea30ad925dd9.mp4?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let machines do the hard work</strong></h2>Use the large range of building stations to develop unique automated technology. Once the robots start doing the hard work, sit down and relax and see things grow.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/6ecd1131234418b515b352670bce99da.poster.avif?t=1698939024\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/6ecd1131234418b515b352670bce99da.webm?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/6ecd1131234418b515b352670bce99da.mp4?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tasty food starts in the farm</strong></h2>Grow a self-sustaining food supply out of a variety of crops, regaining food autonomy in the process! Food items will give you access to a large range of cooking recipes to make your settlers happy.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/f5afcdbe3735b0535df397eb71131d25.poster.avif?t=1698939024\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/f5afcdbe3735b0535df397eb71131d25.webm?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/f5afcdbe3735b0535df397eb71131d25.mp4?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An abandoned factory with a story</strong></h2>Scavenge the abandoned factory, full of resources, history, memories, and failed intentions. Each corner tells you a little bit more of why this place ended up in ruins.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/1acceaa89f7845dd47fb49ba22bae194.poster.avif?t=1698939024\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/1acceaa89f7845dd47fb49ba22bae194.webm?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/962090/extras/1acceaa89f7845dd47fb49ba22bae194.mp4?t=1698939024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contribute to an online catalog of creations!</strong></h2>Design unique habitats and share them online through our in-game online database. Get reputation for contributing to the design of the parts that other players will use. There is nothing like seeing the impact of your ideas out there!","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 7 (latest SP) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 220 / ATI Radeon HD 3870 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 7 (latest SP) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.8 GHz (or AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7870 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Plethora Project"],"publishers":["Plethora Project"],"release_date":"9 Nov, 2022"}